                     <title>Graduale</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Harley 622 was removed to Haughmond at the
                        suppression of Ranton, q. v., in 1537.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Thomas Corveser was last abbot of
                        Haughmond.</note>
                  </msItem>
